*name C06NAT
*call yesmemory
*perso:602300
*no list
*forex
c---- C6 native probe: .EQV. / .NEQV.
      PROGRAM C06NAT
      LOGICAL A,B,R,S
      A=.TRUE.
      B=.FALSE.
      R=A .EQV. B
      S=A .NEQV. B
      PRINT 10,R,S
   10 FORMAT(1X,L2,1X,L2)
      STOP
      END
*execute
*end file
